The law texts in this repository are municipal ordinances of the Partido de Villarino (Province of Buenos Aires), Argentina, taken from
Sistema de Boletines Oficiales Municipales (SIBOM), Subsecretaría Legal y Técnica, Secretaría General, Provincia de Buenos Aires: Boletín Oficial Municipal de Villarino, https://sibom.slyt.gba.gob.ar/cities/133 (consulted 2026-11-01).

They are legal norms: ordinances sanctioned by the Honorable Concejo Deliberante and published in the
Boletín Oficial Municipal de Villarino. Ordinances are public acts of government that bind everyone once officially published.
Argentina's copyright law, Ley 11.723, contains no express exclusion for official texts, and none is claimed over them
here: they are reproduced as public acts of government. The source states no restriction on reuse. They are reproduced
here with this attribution, following the official text.

Changes made by Lexifina: each text was split into one Markdown file per article, one paragraph per line, with spacing
normalised; the wording was not changed. The municipality and the province do not endorse this repository. This
repository is not an official publication; the binding text is the one published in the Boletín Oficial Municipal de Villarino.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
